@RTK.md

## Verifying work

Before saying work is done or pushing, run the repo's own check commands (check AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING, the justfile or CI config for them) and judge each by its exit code, never by reading or grepping its output. Say which checks you ran and which you did not.

